Maybe Pegasus can read minds.

248
00:15:44,740 --> 00:15:47,337
And why the heck hasn't
Tristan come back yet?

249
00:15:47,420 --> 00:15:49,337
We should all be here supporting Yugi.

250
00:15:49,420 --> 00:15:50,250
It's me.

251
00:15:50,333 --> 00:15:51,179
Maybe he got lost.

252
00:15:51,360 --> 00:15:52,220
Good grief.

253
00:15:52,900 --> 00:15:55,417
Don't he realize he's
missing a match at a century?

254
00:15:55,500 --> 00:15:57,382
Pegasus must be reading my mind.

255
00:15:57,540 --> 00:16:01,599
It's the only way he could have been
so prepared to counter my cards.

256
00:16:03,220 --> 00:16:07,037
finally Yugi boy is a
believer how can I win against

257
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:09,817
an opponent who can know
my cards and sense my

258
00:16:09,900 --> 00:16:14,317
strategies as soon as I think
them up how indeed I think

259
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:17,277
oh wait I know you're just
beginning to comprehend my

260
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:20,697
power do you now realize the
magnitude of the jeopardy

261
00:16:20,780 --> 00:16:23,217
you've put yourself in by
accepting this duel how

262
00:16:23,300 --> 00:16:26,077
can you defeat not only the
creator of dual monsters

263
00:16:26,160 --> 00:16:28,617
but It's a duelist who can
read your every thought.

264
00:16:28,700 --> 00:16:30,760
I can see everything in your mind.

265
00:16:30,980 --> 00:16:33,392
Your hopes, your dreams, even your fears.

266
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:36,200
And what you fear most right now is me.

267
00:16:36,520 --> 00:16:37,697
And with good reason.

268
00:16:37,780 --> 00:16:41,721
You know my mind reading abilities
give me an unbeatable advantage.

269
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,551
This is just a nightmare.

270
00:16:43,900 --> 00:16:46,637
We all know Yugi can beat
anybody in a fair duel,

271
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,857
but if Pegasus is able to read his mind,

272
00:16:48,940 --> 00:16:52,197
it's what makes his eye one of the
most powerful millennium items.

273
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:54,417
He can read anyone's mind he chooses.

274
00:16:54,500 --> 00:16:57,597
Anyone who tries to oppose
him must use extreme caution.

275
00:16:57,680 --> 00:16:58,510
I guess so.

276
00:16:58,740 --> 00:17:01,537
You seem to know an awful
lot about that eye, Bakura.

277
00:17:01,620 --> 00:17:02,450
Just a little.

278
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:06,820
One thing I don't know is if any
mere mortal can stand against it.

279
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:10,765
If not, there's no one else who
can save Grandpa and the others.

280
00:17:12,820 --> 00:17:17,526
With the secret staircase and all, they've
got to be hiding something down here.

281
00:17:22,660 --> 00:17:25,366
Man, this is like the
most boring detail ever.

282
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:27,857
I mean, what's the point
of guarding this kid?

283
00:17:27,940 --> 00:17:30,175
Without his soul, he's a total zombie.

284
00:17:30,740 --> 00:17:31,570
Hmm.

285
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:34,440
It's a waste of time. Wanna bet?

286
00:17:40,180 --> 00:17:41,300
Sweet dreams.

287
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:44,080
And the victory goes to Sir Tristan.

288
00:17:44,780 --> 00:17:45,610
Huh?

289
00:17:48,840 --> 00:17:49,670
Mokuba?

290
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:02,934
There's been a breach.

291
00:18:03,520 --> 00:18:07,320
No matter what the odds, I will
never surrender to you, Pegasus.

292
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:10,520
I play one monster in
defense mode and end my turn.

293
00:18:10,660 --> 00:18:12,100
Now, do your worst.

294
00:18:15,360 --> 00:18:16,880
I always do.

295
00:18:19,060 --> 00:18:20,040
What is it?

296
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:23,165
We've detected a potential
problem in Sector 5.

297
00:18:23,360 --> 00:18:26,837
I'm attempting to verify, but
our guard down there won't reply.

298
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:29,977
There appears to be a breach,
and there could be an intruder.

299
00:18:30,060 --> 00:18:33,277
Master Pegasus asked to be notified
immediately should anything...

300
00:18:33,360 --> 00:18:35,478
Master Pegasus is currently dueling.

301
00:18:38,700 --> 00:18:40,260
Then what are your orders?

302
00:18:40,800 --> 00:18:43,220
Listen, secure all the exits.

303
00:18:43,560 --> 00:18:46,040
The boy must not be freed. Yes, sir.

304
00:18:47,580 --> 00:18:49,540
Yugi, you can do it!

305
00:18:49,700 --> 00:18:51,406
Nobody's won this yet, buddy!

306
00:18:54,560 --> 00:18:55,920
Stairwell's closed off.

307
00:18:56,240 --> 00:18:57,240
Just great.

308
00:18:57,520 --> 00:18:59,285
I guess they must be on to me.

309
00:19:00,380 --> 00:19:02,480
Could it be my turn?

310
00:19:05,320 --> 00:19:07,897
What's that sleazeball
gonna pull this time?

311
00:19:07,980 --> 00:19:10,980
It's the moment you've
all been waiting for.

312
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:14,800
First, re-ran in defense mode.

313
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:21,280
Not exactly what you
were expecting, is it?

314
00:19:21,460 --> 00:19:24,519
And I switched the archery
girl to defense mode too.

315
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:33,440
Ah, another dead end.

316
00:19:33,860 --> 00:19:35,560
This way's no good either.

317
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:37,740
Over here!

318
00:19:39,080 --> 00:19:39,910
Trapped.

319
00:19:39,993 --> 00:19:41,297
There's nowhere else to run.

320
00:19:41,380 --> 00:19:42,940
Your move, Yugi.

321
00:19:43,340 --> 00:19:45,160
I'll scramble your egg.

322
00:19:45,380 --> 00:19:48,497
If that's the best you've
got, I'll still defeat you.

323
00:19:48,580 --> 00:19:52,460
Yugi, so full of banter at
this time of dire peril.

324
00:19:52,760 --> 00:19:56,057
I guess he needs another
demonstration of my millennium magic.

325
00:19:56,140 --> 00:19:57,340
All right, Yugi.

326
00:19:57,620 --> 00:20:00,914
First, let's read your mind
and see what's in your hand.

327
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:03,500
Ooh, nice cards.

328
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:06,420
Now what are you going to draw?

329
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:12,300
Could the card you just
drew be Summoned Skull?

330
00:20:12,800 --> 00:20:14,420
Curse you, Pegasus!

331
00:20:15,200 --> 00:20:19,177
I think the Summoned Skull will go
very nicely with your Celtic Guardian,

332
00:20:19,260 --> 00:20:21,857
Spellbinding Circle,
Magical Hats, and Hornim.

333
00:20:21,940 --> 00:20:23,881
He's reading all of Yugi's cards!

334
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:26,057
Don't let him psych you out, buddy!

335
00:20:26,140 --> 00:20:26,970
That's right!

336
00:20:27,053 --> 00:20:28,440
You can still beat him!

337
00:20:29,100 --> 00:20:29,930
How?

338
00:20:30,013 --> 00:20:32,677
He knows all my cards
the instant I draw them!

339
00:20:32,760 --> 00:20:36,740
With that millennium eye
of his, he's unstoppable.
